:\"Example:\"}],\" If your root branch stores 3 GB and your child branches add a combined 0.5 GB of changes, your billed storage would be 3.5 GB, measured proportionally across the month.\"]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"additional-branch-usage-branch-hours\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Additional branch usage (branch-hours)\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#additional-branch-usage-branch-hours\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Additional branch usage (branch-hours)\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$57:8:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Branches are a core feature of Neon, and some use cases call for having many active branches at once. Each plan accounts for a number of simultaneous branches per project at no extra cost; but if you go over that quota, we’ll charge based on how long the extra concurrent branches exist.\"}]\n72:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"This pricing model allows us to \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/blog/may-june-recap\",\"children\":\"safely scale our infrastructure\"}],\" to support high simultaneous branch usage while keeping costs predictable and affordable. You’re free to create and delete branches all month long, and as long as you stay within your plan’s included number of \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"active\"}],\" branches at any given time, you won’t be charged a penny extra.\"]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"