h-write workload = more changes = higher PITR cost.\"}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Example:\"}],\" If you generate 1 GB of data changes per day and set a 7-day restore window, that’s 7 GB of PITR data = $1.40/month.\"]}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You can reduce this cost by shortening your restore window, or eliminate it entirely if you don’t need PITR.\"}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"meet-the-new-plans\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Meet the New Plans\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#meet-the-new-plans\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Meet the New Plans\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$57:8:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"We now offer three plans: Free, Launch, and Scale, with usage-based pricing across the board. This is a summary of how they break down – check out \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/pricing\",\"children\":\"our pricing page\"}],\" for details.\"]}]\n80:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"free-perfect-for-learning-hacking-and-shipping-early-ideas\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Free: Perfect for learning, hacking, and shipping early ideas\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"classNa